1
00:00:00,398 --> 00:00:06,908
(Leonard:)We both have people in our lives
who wanna nip intestinal polyps in the bud.

2
00:00:12,785 --> 00:00:14,875
(Penny:)So, what's new in the world of physics?

3
00:00:15,955 --> 00:00:17,535
(Leonard:)Nothing.

4
00:00:18,458 --> 00:00:19,958
Really? Nothing?

5
00:00:20,126 --> 00:00:25,626
(Leonard:)Well, with the exception of string theory,
not much has happened since the 1930s...

6
00:00:25,798 --> 00:00:27,508
(Leonard:)...and you can't prove string theory.

7
00:00:27,675 --> 00:00:33,135
At best you can say, "Hey, look, my idea
has an internal logical consistency."

8
00:00:34,265 --> 00:00:37,935
(Penny:)Ah. Well, I'm sure things will pick up.

9
00:00:42,023 --> 00:00:44,023
(Leonard:)What's new at the Cheesecake Factory?

10
00:00:44,192 --> 00:00:46,652
(Penny:)Oh, uh, not much.

11
00:00:46,819 --> 00:00:51,199
Oh, we do have a chocolate key lime
that's moving pretty well.

12
00:00:51,365 --> 00:00:54,825
(Sheldon:)Good.

13
00:00:57,747 --> 00:01:02,027
Uh, what about
your, uh, hallway friend?

